    <comp lib="9" loc="(1133,214)" name="Text">
      <a name="text">LAB 03 — DON'T-CARE K-MAP

Function
F(A,B,C,D) = Σm(0,2,5,7,8,10,13,15)

Don't-Care Conditions
d(1,3,9,11)

Objective
To simplify a Boolean function using don't-care conditions in a Karnaugh map.

K-Map Result
F = B'D' + D

Implementation
The simplified expression is implemented using NOT, AND, and OR gates.

Verification
The circuit is tested against all defined input combinations. Don't-care combinations may produce either 0 or 1.</a>
    </comp>
